### Complicated (Function?)
Ib = Inertia_bar = 1/3 * Mass_Bar ((Len_BarCW**3 + Len_BarPW**3)/(Len_BarPW + Len_BarlW))
I = Mass_CW * Len_BarPW**2 + Mass_PW * Len_BarCW**2 + Inertia_bar
V = Mass_CW * g * Len_BarPW - Mass_PW * g * l - 1/2 * Mass_CW * g * (Len_BarPW - Len_BarCW)


I dot theta =Mlh dot phi sin( theta+ phi)+Mlh dot phi ^ 2 * cos(theta + phi) + V * cos(theta)
h dot phi =l dot theta sin( theta+ phi)+l dot theta ^ 2 * cos(theta + phi) - g * sin(phi)


